qingming-z-image-turbo
Copyright 2026 qingming-z-image-turbo contributors

This product is an unofficial native HIP/C++ implementation for running
Z-Image-Turbo on AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX / gfx1100 hardware.

PROJECT WORK
------------

Original work in this project includes, as applicable:

- Native C++/HIP inference orchestration
- gfx1100 BF16 WMMA kernels
- Persistent GEMM scheduling
- Fused QKV, attention, and FFN execution paths
- GPU-resident static execution graphs
- Resolution-specific DiT and VAE execution
- Q8_0, Q6_K, and Q5_K_M GGUF execution paths
- Build, download, benchmarking, and documentation utilities

